{"title":"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If two factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/0/0702ae8cc289a9783f1f8a64d80bd33fcfb9f677.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x^3-hx+k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"16\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8ab0ec5027c055e1b34dc345b1d8532b611bce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4baf6d4b1cfa69b68b3204b5e2eba0c5755fe20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/8/9b8b4f167da6563931a64e242fe36084aca425b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|2h-3k|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/7/ef7d68b0e4f99f1615dbb150245826eb7541c7c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 4\\quad \\text{(B) } 3\\quad \\text{(C) } 2\\quad \\text{(D) } 1\\quad \\text{(E) } 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"263\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the Remainder Theorem, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/c/22c73c748a8f1867b0d2adfdc4ee746612572d13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(-2)^3 - h(-2) + k = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"189\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/4/8045e6e95fbe8dee9883f8b362970a1f426b3184.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(1)^3 - h(1) + k = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"160\" height=\"19\" />.  Simplifying both of those equations gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/f/5dfd5e177e135ecb4a556399e816ebf3e211efe3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-16 + 2h + k = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"139\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/f/a6fe8271988a309951d277029fabd3c0d0a88525.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 - h + k = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"109\" height=\"16\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/9/809ca4d4b7573fdcaefd56706d123adad050eb8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 16 - 2h$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"93\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/5/b25963214030c03f0d1c0891327e841ed5e1e939.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = h - 2$\" width=\"75\" height=\"12\" />, we set those equal to get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/9/d39fd4e40bf97e21d2371f5a5b846a9c67100c49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16 - 2h = h - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"125\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/2/c424fa38d9086669953cda486aaa52796b89b4c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3h = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/7/2777d9c2d889051156950faa055367dd36d906a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h = 6$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>This gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/4/1b4096f1768d4b1191ccc0386de6b4cc16503a1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> when substituting back into either of the two equations, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/d/3dd46bf3cffd3f78a441f4b9108ca52357559306.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|2h - 3k| = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"104\" height=\"18\" />, which is answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/e/62effaf0d5dc9bfa1d137bed40c4baa73698962d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME\" title=\"1970 AHSME\">1970 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1970 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1970\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"19